dialect protocol
protocol drawing.spr
version 1
schema drawing.document.mutation
start record
framing record
record drawing.drawing-add-layer tag 1
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record drawing.drawing-set-stroke tag 2
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record drawing.drawing-move-layer tag 3
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
chain hash u64
